    {
      "id": "2072141059124019319",
      "text": "Codex UI frustration solution...\n\nI have really been struggling with some very simple things, like just getting a text box to work properly with scrolling on my iPhone app. \n\nIn the end, I got so fed up with trying to get it to work, I just asked Codex to go back to the basic native iPhone text field functionality and strip everything else that we built. \n\nKind of starting from scratch again. \n\nBut that actually fixed it, and then I could add other improvements off to that point.",
